=XRn38FMiko0Q7kNvwFhvLGq&_nc_oc=AdoXpLcCafsaWksvMDaW1MlP8WQ-tBCuYbwzhp5AAlNeZ1vnqM1vbb6BPuiuiU2wBAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXbd6E1DQjSIEfPEMgYIrTAMiD0t8ZgRncbYfmn9-RrTg&oe=6B105CC1"}, {"file_name": "Eternal_Love_and_Fight_039.8s_vehicle_EnemyVehicleDrone_od_0.png", "id": "948696638001312", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_948696641334645_4081968092701997310_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zvrNWNltYgkQ7kNvwGjg2dj&_nc_oc=AdqXfegwTsdL_rTxM5nkzis4OhEY13pG0igglQwYGghXQtX8jaZvY8lCoc-rFt3XbkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUaPTpagRY_7Bj8n0CqjZ-b3H8KqaJx6ksLRsu0JWgldA&oe=6B10575F"}, {"file_name": "12.png", "id": "1444560827423347", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619718_1444560830756680_3298850522319972552_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ReTtAeFxLEQ7kNvwH_PWrD&_nc_oc=AdpHnuy9oGe31yBTrGP-g_Rz3QFKkPVX7_tlnMTQsTfNE4CxLn3VTdEC_btbFY2Z1Ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXfI4xKm0WJlGHsBFPdQp_qD4ctdtYfz-YV2Q7p8-uU0Q&oe=6B104D52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape cover3.png", "id": "931648519979145", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_931648523312478_842223399553496432_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dE_4Yxx9k3cQ7kNvwEVghzG&_nc_oc=AdqQ6g5mGRHLid8B2MrkG2He6ipJftC6h6dK-9OkJV9oe3HzVfKJACfqDtCn2cIGyi0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWxVeei3A4ha1n31n2KjUqESOlOm3k9rBMJQ5bVFCJIIA&oe=6B106287"}, "display_name": "One Shot Beat", "keywords": ["shoot", "beat", "rhythm", "gun", "action"], "long_description": "#  **One Shot. One Beat. One Flow**\n  \n  Leap through dimensional rifts into explosive music-powered worlds. Blast enemy swarms, dodge incoming fire, and let every beat drive your next shot.\n\n#  **Rhythm Meets Action**\n\n  Shoot on the beat, weave through incoming attacks, and build unstoppable momentum as every perfect shot fuels the action.\n\n#  **Play Your Own Music**\n\nBring your own songs. Choose any theme of the 5 worlds, get in the flow with your loved tracks.\n\n#  **Choose Your Challenge**\n\n  Pick your difficulty and feel the beat your way. On harder modes your streak hits harder, you can deflect bullets with your shield, and every beat feels more intense.\n\n #  **Worlds Built on Music**\n  \nEvery world has its own look, its own sound and its own enemies. Race along neon highways through floating cyber-cities as drones and attack choppers sweep across the sky. Ride a disco train through deep space and fight your way across glowing dance floors among the stars. Sneak through the jungle as masked tribal warriors close in to the drums. Battle across city rooftops and face a towering boss who won't go down quietly. Push through endless desert dunes and ancient temples as undead armies rise to meet you. Each  journey is built around its song: the music sets the pace, shapes every wave, and turns every fight into a performance.\n\n  More rifts are opening. New worlds with completely different themes, new songs and new enemies are on the way.\n", "short_description": "One Shot. One Beat. One Flow.\n  Leap through dimensional rifts into explosive music-powered worlds, from neon cyber-cities to disco trains in space and ancient deserts. Play with different genres or use your own songs! Blast enemy swarms, dodge incoming fire, and let every beat drive your next shot. New worlds are on the way."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.cosmic-caravan.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.cosmic-caravan.com/copy-of-privacy-policy", "publisher_name": "CosmicCaravan", "support_website_url": "https://www.cosmic-caravan.com/", "website_url": "https://www.cosmic-carav